{{template "preamble"}}

{{template "logobar"}}

<div class="ui hidden divider"></div>

<div class="ui container">

   <div class="ui huge header">Welcome to ISBE</div>
   <p>
      You can use two different methods to log in to ISBE. Choose the one that best suits your needs.
   </p>

   <div class="ui stackable two column grid">
      <div class="column">
         <div class="ui raised segment" style="border-radius:1rem">
            <h3 class="ui center aligned header">
               With a representation certificate
            </h3>

            <div class="ui basic fitted center aligned segment">
               <a href="/cert/login?code={{ .authCode }}" class="certificate ui large black submit circular button">Use
                  a certificate</a>
            </div>

            <div class="ui divider"></div>

            <p>The certificate to use is the same digital certificate with which a legal representative of an
               organization signs documents on behalf of an organization (e.g. in PDF format) or identifies
               themselves in the electronic headquarters of the Public Administration to act as a representative 
               of that organization.
            </p>
            <p>Personal digital certificates cannot be used.</p>


         </div>
      </div>
      <div class="column">
         <div class="ui raused segment" style="border-radius:1rem">
            <h3 class="ui center aligned header">
               With a Verifiable Credential
            </h3>

            <div class="ui basic fitted center aligned segment">
               <a href="/wallet/login?code={{ .authCode }}"
                  class="credential ui large black submit circular button">Use Verifiable Credential</a>
            </div>

            <div class="ui divider"></div>

            <p>For this identification mechanism, you need the legal representative of your organization to
               generate a Verifiable Credential for you,
               declaring that you have certain powers to act on behalf of the company.
            </p>
            <p>Of course, if you are a
               legal representative,
               you can generate a Verifiable Credential for yourself. But to do so you must first use your
               representation certificate to enter the system.
            </p>


         </div>
      </div>

   </div>

</div>

{{template "postamble"}}
